              <rules>
                <rule id="e403-7cab-5502-dfa5" name="Armoury Assets" hidden="false">
                  <description>Upgrade 1-2 units in this formation: Predator to Predator Infernus (+20 pts each); Predator to Predator Executioner (+20 pts each); Predator to Whirlwind Scorpius (+20 pts each). Once this upgrade is taken, the upgraded units appear in the formation, next to the units they replace; pick them there.</description>
